 "text": "9/29/26, 9:48 AM\nFeatures\n\nWhen this operation is executed, the Contract Accounts that are related to the provided Business Partner Internal ID are retrieved.\nA Business Partner Internal ID is mandatory; if you do not provide one, you will receive an error message and no results will be\nreturned.\n\nError Handling\nIf you do not enter a Business Partner Internal ID , you will receive an error.\n\nNo Contract Account will be found if you enter an invalid Business Partner Internal ID. Note : Users should have the proper\nauthorization in order to display Contract Accounts.\n\nMessage Types\n\ne ContractAccountERPByBusinessPartnerQuery_sync\n\ne ContractAccountERPByBusinessPartnerResponse_sync\n\nPrerequisites\n\nTo use this service operation, the FI-CA application component should be implemented.\n\nNotes on SAP Implementation\n\nSwitch Framework: Any business function set that includes an activated FICA switch via related business functions can use this\nservice.\n\nConfiguration:\n\nThe operation is suitable for the following sectors in particular: Contract A/R and A/P, Industry Extension Public Sector, Insurance,\nSAP Media, Telco and Utilities. However, it is necessary that the customer runs the FI-CA application component in order to use it.\nNote : Users must have the proper authorization in order to display a Contract Account (authorization object F_KKVK_BEG).\n\nEnhancements:\n\nEvents are defined for additional function modules that can be called as customer exits for defining specific inbound/outbound\napplication mapping logic.\n\ne For inbound mapping:\n\no Event 4604\n\no FICA Services: Inbound XI Mapping ContractAccountByBPld\n\no Sample module: FKK_SAMPLE_4604 in function group FKK_XI_LEVENTS\ne For outbound mapping:\n\no Event 4605\n\nnm EICA Carvirac: Oithaniind X\u00a5I \\Janning CnntrartArncnni intRvRDIF\n",
